exports[`rhx enroll — a role modded via .agent/repo=.mods given: [case2] a mod with no of when: [t0] a clone is enrolled with the modded role then: the refusal stderr matches its snapshot 1`] = `
"
✋ ConstraintError: the mod of role=surfer is refused: its boot.yml declares no \`of:\`

{
  "mod": ".agent/repo=.mods/role=surfer/",
  "subject": "boot.yml",
  "fix": "add \`of: test/surfer\` — the role this mod is over (and, optionally, \`@<version>\`)"
}

[args] enroll,claude,--roles,surfer

"
`;

